                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i5"><locus from="24v" to="25r" facs="025"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4965Kwellomu">Kʷǝllomu śarāwita malāʾǝkt yǝsebbǝḥuki</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">ኵሎሙ፡ ሠራዊተ፡ መላእክት፡ መንፈሳውያን፡ ነደ፡ እሳት፡ እሙንቱ፡</incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i6"><locus from="25r" to="25v" facs="025"/><title>Hymn to God, “You are in the Heavens, You are on the Earth,”</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">አንተ፡ በሰማይ፡ ወአንተ፡ በምድር፡ ወአንተ፡ በባሕር፡ ዘታስተጋብኦሙ፡ ለኵሉ፡ ፍጥረት፡ እምአጽናፈ፡ ምድር።..</incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i7"><locus from="25v" to="26v" facs="026"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3063RepCh343">Hymn to Our Lady Mary</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">እሴብሕ፡ ጸጋኪ፡ ማርያም፡ ወእስእለኪ፡ ከመ፡ ታብርሂ፡ ልብየ፡ ወታርትዒ፡ ፍኖትየ፡</incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i8"><locus from="26v" to="28v" facs="027"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT6347SalamWatchful">Salām lakǝmu malāʾǝkt tǝguhān</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">ሰላም፡ ለክሙ፡ ማኅበረ፡ መላእክት፡ ትጉሃን፡ ሰላም፡ ለክሙ፡ ማኅበረ፡ ነቢያት፡ ቅዱሳን፡ </incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i9"><locus from="28v" to="32r" facs="032"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2260salota">Ṣalota kidān</title></msItem>
