                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i11"><locus from="32v" to="37v" facs="033"/><title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2384Taamme">Taʾammǝra Māryām</title>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i11.1"><locus from="32v" to="34v" facs="033"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3586Miracle">Miracle of Mary: Miracle of Hildephonsus (Dexius) of
        Toledo</title></msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i11.2"><locus from="34v" to="36v" facs="035"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3615Miracle">Miracle of Mary: The Story of the Cannibal of Qǝmr</title></msItem>
                    <msItem xml:id="ms_i11.3"><locus from="36v" to="37v" facs="037"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3693Miracle">Miracle of Mary: Miracle of an evil officer at Tarsus in Cilicia
        who loved Mary and had an apparition of Jesus</title></msItem>
                  </msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i12"><locus from="37v" to="38v" facs="038"/><title>Prayer of Thanksgiving from the Missal</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">ጸሎተ፡ አኰቴት። ነአኵቶ፡ ለገባሬ፡ ሠናያት፡ ላዕሌነ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ መሀሪ፡ አቡሁ፡ለእግዚእነ፡ ወአምላክነ፡ ወመድኃኒነ፡ ኢየሰ፡ (sic) ክርስቶስ፡</incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i13"><locus from="38v" to="38v" facs="039"/><title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3519Epistle">Epistle to the Ephesians</title><note>excerpt</note></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i14"><locus from="38v" to="38v" facs="039"/><title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3509Epistle">First Epistle of John</title><note>excerpt</note></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i15"><locus from="38v" to="39r" facs="039"/><title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1019Actsof">Gǝbra ḥawāryāt</title><note>excerpt</note></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i16"><locus from="39r" to="39v" facs="039"/><title>Hymn, “This is the Time of Praise and this is the time of the Chosen Incense,” from the Missal</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">ዝ፡ ውእቱ፡ ጊዜ፡ ባርኮት፡ ወዝውእቱ፡ ጊዜ፡ ዕጣን፡ ኅሩይ፡ </incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i17"><locus from="39v" to="40r" facs="040"/><title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT1693John#Ch1">Gospel of John (Collection):  Ch1</title></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i18"><locus from="40r" to="41r" facs="040"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT5441ApostolicCreed">Creed of the Apostles</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">ጸሎተ፡ ሃይማኖት፡ ነአምን፡ በ፩፡ አምላክ፡ ገባሬ ኵሉ፡ ፍጥረት፡ አብ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡ ወመድኃኒነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ እስመ፡ አልቦ፡ ውስተ፡ ህላዌሁ፡ አመክንዮ፡  </incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i19"><locus from="41r" to="41v" facs="041"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3308Nicene">Nicene Creed</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">ጸሎተ፡ ሃይማኖት፡ ነአምን፡ በ፩፡ አምላክ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ አብ፡ አኃዜ፡ ኵሉ፡ ገባሬ፡ ሰማያት፡ ወምድር፡ ዘያስተርኢ፡ ወዘኢያስተርኢ፡</incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i20"><locus from="41v" to="44v" facs="042"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2444Temher">Tǝmhǝrta ḫǝbuʾāt</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">በእንተ፡ ትእምርተ፡ ኅቡዓት፡ ቅድመ፡ ዘትትነገር፡ እምጵርስፎራ፡ </incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i21"><locus from="44v" to="51r" facs="045"/><title>Hymn to Mary, “Greeting to you, Mary,”</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">አአትብ፡ ገጽየ፡ በኃይለ፡ ሃይማኖት፡ ዘነፍስ፡</incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i22"><locus from="51r" to="54r" facs="051"/><title>Hymn to Mary, “Greeting to you, Heavenly Altar,”</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">ሰላም፡ ለኪ፡ ሰማያዊት፡ ምሥዋዕ፡</incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i23"><locus from="54r" to="54r" facs="054"/><title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT5888AsmatPrayer"> Asmat prayer for safety in childbirth, written for Wärq Afärahu</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ አብ፡ ክቡር፡ ፍልድያኖስ፡ በስመ፡ ወልድ፡ ሜሎስ፡ ወበስመ፡ መንፈስ፡ ቅዱስ፡ ማኅየዊ፡ ጥቅያኖስ፡</incipit></msItem>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i24"><locus from="54v" to="55r" facs="055"/><title>Prayer after Communion, excerpt from Missal</title><incipit xml:lang="gez">ወእምድኅረ፡ አስተናጽሖ፡ ፍጹመ፡ መልዓት፡ እግዚኦ፡ ምሥጢርከ፡</incipit></msItem>
